<title>UK: Iran tells OPEC its output at quota in October.</title>
<headline>Iran tells OPEC its output at quota in October.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran told OPEC's Secretariat it produced at quota in October, the OPEC News Agency said.</p>
<p>Iran said it pumped 3.595 million barrels per day (bpd), just below its 3.6 million quota.</p>
<p>Data for the month of October received so far by the OPEC Secretariat from member countries is as follows (in 1,000 bpd):</p>
<p> Country	Production     Supply</p>
<p> Algeria	   797.0	  769.0</p>
<p> Indonesia     1,325.6	    N/A</p>
<p> Iran	    3,595.0	3,595.0</p>
<p> Iraq		740.0	  740.0</p>
<p> Kuwait	  2,002.4	2,003.2</p>
<p> Libya	   1,400.0	1,401.0</p>
<p> Qatar	     386.2	    N/A</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia  8,022.6	8,003.5</p>
<p> UAE	     2,230.3	2,201.9</p>
<p>N/A - NOT AVAILABLE</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
